1005
00:48:45.708 --> 00:48:46.875
- Catherine!
- Oh.

1006
00:48:47.541 --> 00:48:48.791
Julian!

1007
00:48:49.250 --> 00:48:50.375
[laughs]

1008
00:48:51.333 --> 00:48:52.791
- Hello.
- Hi.

1009
00:48:52.875 --> 00:48:55.375
