1043
00:50:20.125 --> 00:50:23.375
- [Catherine] Mm.
- Wow.

1044
00:50:24.333 --> 00:50:26.250
- That's a Cézanne.
- [Catherine] Yeah.

1045
00:50:26.333 --> 00:50:28.125
