1060
00:51:11.333 --> 00:51:13.583
undying love.

1061
00:51:14.291 --> 00:51:15.500
It's all love.

1062
00:51:15.583 --> 00:51:17.666
[Catherine] I've never
thought about it that way.

1063
00:51:17.750 --> 00:51:19.958
You really know
