1075
00:51:52.666 --> 00:51:55.083
Oh. that's good. We never
really liked them. did we?

1076
00:51:55.166 --> 00:51:56.875
Erwins is auctioning
this collection?

1077
00:51:56.958 --> 00:52:00.500
- Yes! Isn't that fun?
- [Julian] So fun!

1078
00:52:00.583 --> 00:52:01.583
Yes!

1079
