So. I'm sorry.

1080
00:52:03.583 --> 00:52:06.125
Your last name is Brovil?

1081
00:52:06.208 --> 00:52:08.791
Cause I just assumed
it was. it was DeLaroche.

1082
00:52:08.875 --> 00:52:11.708
Well. technically. it's Brovil.
I just thought DeLaroche

1083
