head manager. head cheerleader.

1164
00:56:25.791 --> 00:56:29.166
Wow. Seems like
a lot of responsibility.

1165
00:56:29.250 --> 00:56:30.458
What are you guys called?

1166
00:56:30.541 --> 00:56:32.375
